            <h1>Meet Sorty, the next-best-use tool for unwanted clothing.</h1>
            <p>Sorty is a computer vision mobile application that helps users determine the next best use for unwanted clothing in just a few taps.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions" data-reveal="up">
              <a class="button lime" href="#waitlist">Notify me at launch</a>
              <a class="button light" href="{{ url('/contact?interest=pilot') }}">Request a pilot</a>
